  "description": "Refurbishment and access improvements to the hut, including: Converting half of the space from a volunteer's space, to a food and goods service/shop, and the other half from a biodigester equipment room to a new volunteer's space. Replacement of all defective or rotten timber, including two posts in full, replacement of both doors for new timber glazed doors, replacement of the high-level windows with openable units, replacement of rotten timber post bases with metal post bases, refinishing all externally exposed timber with a clear varnish, replacement of the remaining Perspex domed roof with a flat roof to match the half already completed, install vertical timber solar shading fins to east and west elevations, install a brise-soleil to the south/front elevation, install a ramp to reinstate the original design, with the addition of new steps, and remove the redundant wind turbine and associated equipment.",
